Package: maio-cluster
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: ShieldDog-ACE <shielddog-ace@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/ShieldDog-ACE/maio-cluster
Depends: adduser
Recommends: maio-llama
Description: lightweight llama.cpp model manager and Ollama-compatible service
 maio registers, downloads and deletes GGUF models, runs local inference with
 llama.cpp and exposes an Ollama/OpenAI-compatible HTTP API to the LAN.
 .
 V3 adds a bounded request queue, API-key authentication, per-client rate
 limiting, Prometheus metrics, a crash-restart supervisor, resident-model
 restore, a 200 MB control-plane memory target and a hardened systemd unit.
